      "text": "Countries and their problems:\n\nSouth Asia \n🇮🇳 India – Overworked workforce, uneven pay\n🇵🇰 Pakistan – Education without enough jobs\n🇧🇩 Bangladesh – Dense population, limited resources\n🇦🇫 Afghanistan – Life shaped by conflict and restriction\n\nMiddle East \n🇮🇱 Israel – Permanent security tension\n🇮🇷 Iran – Heavy limits on personal freedoms\n🇹🇷 Turkey – Inflation eroding incomes\n🇦🇪 UAE – High comfort, limited citizenship rights\n🇾🇪 Yemen – Hunger and humanitarian crisis\n🇱🇧 Lebanon – Financial system collapse\n\nEast & Southeast Asia \n🇨🇳 China – Strong state surveillance\n🇯🇵 Japan – Extreme work culture\n🇰🇷 South Korea – High stress, high debt\n🇵🇭 Philippines – Hard work, slow mobility\n🇮🇩 Indonesia – Cheap labor, wealth gap\n🇹🇭 Thailand – Fragile democracy\n🇲🇾 Malaysia – Brain drain pressure\n🇸🇬 Singapore – Wealth with intense pressure\n\nEurope \n🇬🇧 UK – High taxes, falling purchasing power\n🇫🇷 France – Protest culture, slow reform\n🇩🇪 Germany – Overregulation slows innovation\n🇮🇹 Italy – Aging power, limited youth growth\n🇪🇸 Spain – Educated youth, weak job market\n🇬🇷 Greece – Long-term debt hangover\n🇵🇱 Poland – Politics over institutions\n🇭🇺 Hungary – Power concentration\n🇸🇪 Sweden – Integration and crime concerns\n🇳🇴 Norway – High income, heavy taxation\n🇨🇭 Switzerland – High quality, high cost\n\nAmericas \n🇺🇸 USA – Polarized society, gridlocked politics\n🇨🇦 Canada – Housing affordability crisis\n🇲🇽 Mexico – Cartel influence in regions\n🇧🇷 Brazil – Violence and inequality\n🇦🇷 Argentina – Chronic inflation\n🇻🇪 Venezuela – Economic collapse despite oil\n🇨🇺 Cuba – Equality with limited opportunity\n\nAfrica \n🇳🇬 Nigeria – Resource wealth, widespread poverty\n🇿🇦 South Africa – Crime and inequality\n🇪🇬 Egypt – Currency instability\n🇪🇹 Ethiopia – Politics over livelihoods\n🇸🇩 Sudan – Conflict-driven survival\n🇸🇴 Somalia – Weak central control\n🇰🇪 Kenya – Youth unemployment\n🇹🇿 Tanzania – Low-income survival economy\n🇺🇬 Uganda – Suppressed dissent\n🇷🇼 Rwanda – Stability over political freedom\n🇨🇩 DR Congo – Resource exploitation\n🇲🇱 Mali – Conflict over education\n🇧🇫 Burkina Faso – Terrorism threat\n\nOceania \n🇦🇺 Australia – Rent and cost-of-living squeeze\n🇳🇿 New Zealand – Quality life, high costs",
